for this example, when you specify to create PVCs, the CG needs to be replicatedprior to running this example.

This is required because the target ibox volume's ID is required to build the 
PV volumeHandle for it when you are creating target PVC/PVs like this
example does.

Also, you will need to suspend replication of the CG in order to 
perform a cleanup of the volumes created by this example.
